"""agentbox — operator CLI for the Agentbox platform.

Subcommands:
  validate            repo hygiene checks (secrets, bindings, compose guardrails)
  deploy SERVICE      validate then docker-compose up a service with its env file
  doctor              live-host health probes (endpoints, services, docker, disk)
  status              one-line service/port summary
  policy check ACTION resolve an action against policies/approval-policy.yaml
"""
